{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ilo, a 19-year-old student, is turned into a vampire against their will. Stuck in a crumbling northern town that is still weirdly buzzing with secret vampire activities, Ilo is about to rediscover their hometown through entirely new eyes. Along the way, they are going to meet new friends, cross paths with a few dangerous but charismatic vampires, and try to find their place in this twisted, shared world of vampires and humans.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/extras/petCat.gif?t=1750091359\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ilo is not the type to sit quietly: they are energetic, determined, and resourceful. Whatever it is, cooking, crafting, installing software, or doing any possible and impossible jobs, they will do what it takes to make ends meet. Expect dozens of mini-games with sometimes painfully realistic processes of getting an extra penny.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/extras/graveyard.gif?t=1750091359\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And of course, the town is full of <strong>stray cats</strong> to pet, feed, and (who knows?) adopt. \u0421ause even vampires need furry friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665100?t=1750091359","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665100?t=1750091359","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/626d382ecdb65a15475bccd12831dff056a41729/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750091359","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/626d382ecdb65a15475bccd12831dff056a417